@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white

actor Member
participant "Static site\n(Vercel)" as Site
participant "Flutter Web\n(Vercel)" as App
participant "API" as API
database "Postgres" as DB

note over Site, App
  Primary seamless path (D3): shared session cookie.
  This diagram is the **fallback** only.
end note

Member -> Site : already signed in
Site -> API : createOneTimeCode()\n(authenticated)
API -> DB : insert OneTimeCode\n(hash, TTL 5 min, single use)
API --> Site : { code, expires_at }
Site -> App : handoff URL with code\n(not the JWT)
App -> API : exchangeOneTimeCode(code)
API -> DB : validate;\nmark used
alt invalid / expired / used
  API --> App : 422 otc_*
else ok
  API --> App : session as S1\n(Set-Cookie Web)
end

@enduml
